This word family is allofamic to {{och-l|揚}}, its Tibeto-Burman cognates, & ancestor {{cog|sit-pro|*laŋ}}; as well as {{och-l|輿}} & {{och-l|舉}} ({{zh-ref|Schuessler, 2007}}, see also {{zh-ref|Baxter & Sagart, 1998}}).

